    {
      "id": "p0040-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Whether they want it or not, many successful authors, musicians, directors, and celebrities stand atop a pedestal of fame that puts them out of reach of the ordinary person. To some degree, this applies to video game creators, too.",
        "raw": "Whether they want it or not, many successful authors, musicians, directors,\nand celebrities stand atop a pedestal of fame that puts them out of reach of the\nordinary person. To some degree, this applies to video game creators, too.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28728862,
          0.09195714,
          0.88586881,
          0.14116429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28526986,
          0.09124286,
          0.88788756,
          0.14223571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "许多成功的作家、音乐人、导演和名人，无论愿不愿意，都被名气抬到了普通人难以接近的位置。游戏创作者在某种程度上也一样。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
