    {
      "id": "p0040-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby Fox, the developer of Undertale, is the opposite: despite his fame, he's literally just an ordinary guy from the Internet who makes weird jokes and hangs out online. Here is his story.",
        "raw": "Toby Fox, the developer of Undertale, is the opposite: despite his fame, he's\nliterally just an ordinary guy from the Internet who makes weird jokes and\nhangs out online. Here is his story.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28816677,
          0.15681429,
          0.85937269,
          0.20567857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28526986,
          0.1561,
          0.88788756,
          0.20675
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 的开发者 Toby Fox 却相反：虽然出名，他确实就是个普通网友，上网闲逛，说些怪笑话。下面是他的故事。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
