    {
      "id": "p0040-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby grows up playing popular video games that are considered classics today. He's especially fond of Japanese role-playing games that have been translated into English. These games feature memorable stories, characters, and music.",
        "raw": "Toby grows up playing popular video games that are considered classics today.\nHe's especially fond of Japanese role-playing games that have been translated\ninto English. These games feature memorable stories, characters, and music.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28816677,
          0.24836429,
          0.88500075,
          0.29687857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28526986,
          0.24765,
          0.88788756,
          0.29795
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          9,
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 玩着当时的热门游戏长大，那些游戏如今已是经典。他尤其喜欢译成英语的日式角色扮演游戏，里面有令人难忘的故事、角色和音乐。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
