    {
      "id": "p0040-b009",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Of course, it's not accurate to say that Toby created Undertale entirely by himself. He received lots of help from friends and supporters during the game's development - everything from art to character design to fashion tips, and more. Although Toby did create the vast majority of the game, it would be unfair to discount the work of everyone else who contributed. Without their contributions, Undertale would be a noticeably different game today.",
        "raw": "Of course, it's not accurate to say that Toby created Undertale entirely by\nhimself. He received lots of help from friends and supporters during the\ngame's development - everything from art to character design to fashion tips,\nand more. Although Toby did create the vast majority of the game, it would\nbe unfair to discount the work of everyone else who contributed. Without\ntheir contributions, Undertale would be a noticeably different game today.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.30821298,
          0.80174286,
          0.88073109,
          0.89094286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.30690079,
          0.80102857,
          0.88204327,
          0.89201429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          32,
          33,
          34,
          35,
          36,
          37
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "当然，说 Toby 完全独自制作了 Undertale 并不准确。开发时，朋友和支持者提供了许多帮助：绘画、角色设计、穿搭建议，等等。虽然游戏绝大部分确由 Toby 完成，忽略其他人的贡献仍不公平。没有他们，如今的 Undertale 会明显不同。",
